{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19912","headline":"秋怀 七 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老病多异虑，朝夕非一心。\n商虫哭衰运，繁响不可寻。\n秋草瘦如发，贞芳缀疎金。\n晚鲜讵几时，驰景还易阴。\n弱习徒自耻，莫知欲何任。\n露才一见谗，潜智早已深。\n防深不防露，此意古所箴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}